    - key: collect_purple_100
      value: Collect 100 Purple Mushrooms
    - key: explore_valley
      value: Explore the Valley
    - key: find_hidden_notes
      value: Find the Hidden Notes
    - key: "\u041D\u0430\u043C\u0435\u0440\u0438 \u0440\u0443\u0431\u0438\u043D\u0430"
      value: Find the Ruby
    - key: save_yourself
      value: Save Yourself!
    - key: note_1_content
      value: I don't know how you ended up here, but if you're reading this, you're probably as lost as I was.\n\nThis valley is full of strange things. Flowers, mushrooms, plants I've never seen before (I don't go outside though, so I guess I haven't seen a lot of things). Don't just walk past them. Take what you can.\n\nI've learned that the valley seems to reward those who pay attention to what it has to offer.\n\nGood luck. You'll need it...
    - key: note_2_title
      value: Field Note #4
    - key: note_2_content
      value: I've started collecting the mushrooms around here. At first, I thought they were just pretty little things, but I've noticed something strange.\n\nThe more I collect, the more I seem to discover.\n\nPurple ones are particularly interesting. I wonder how many it would take to get someone's attention...
    - key: note_3_title
      value: Something Shiny
    - key: note_3_content
      value: I saw it again last night. A ruby, sitting on the pond bridge.\n\nI tried looking for it during the day, but it was nowhere to be found.\n\nIt seems the thing only appears after the sun goes down. I suppose I'll have to become a night explorer...
    - key: note_4_title
      value: My Greatest Discovery
    - key: note_4_content
      value: I finally figured it out!\n\nThe old fireplace isn't just decoration. I found some old writing that says it burns hot enough to burn anything, even gems!\n\nI haven't tried it myself, I've become too attached to my jewels.\n\nBut if you want to leave this place, perhaps that's what you need to do...
    - key: note_5_title
      value: July 25
    - key: note_5_content
      value: Dear Diary,\n\nI have now collected 47 purple mushrooms.\n\nWhy 47? I have absolutely no idea.\n\nI only wanted to get 10, but then I found another, and another, and another.\n\nI think I may have a problem. At least they're not poisonous...\n\nProbably.
    - key: note_6_title
      value: Another Observation
    - key: note_6_content
      value: Purple mushrooms aren't the only interesting ones here.\n\nI've started noticing orange mushrooms growing in the warmer parts of the valley.\n\nI wonder if collecting different kinds of plants is the key to uncovering everything this place has to offer...
    - key: note_7_title
      value: Weather Report
    - key: note_7_content
      value: 'It rained yesterday.\n\nIt rained today.\n\nI suspect it will rain tomorrow.\n\nI''ve decided that the valley has two seasons: rain and slightly less rain.\n\nOn the bright side, the flowers seem happy!'
    - key: note_8_title
      value: Day 23
    - key: note_8_content
      value: I came here looking for adventure. I expected mountains, trees, and maybe a nice place to camp.\n\nI didn't expect to spend three weeks collecting mushrooms.\n\nSometimes I wonder whether the valley is testing me, or whether I've simply lost my mind.\n\nEither way, I don't think I'm ready to leave.
    - key: note_9_title
      value: One Last Thing
    - key: note_9_content
      value: It's holding you here...\n\nyou must destroy it...\n\nbefore it destroys you...
